# Ticket 45 (#180): optional /opt/cmp/.env lines for the demo analysis·Sandbox·Claude runtime.
# Copy only what you turn on into /opt/cmp/.env (root, 0600) in an SSM session, then release.
# Never commit real values. Keys ensure-secrets.sh generates (ENV_FILE_ENCRYPTION_KEY, …) are
# not listed here; build values (PLATFORM_ECR_REGISTRY, BUILD_*) come from deploy-build-stack.sh.
#
# Real analysis. Both lines → the analysis queue registers the real Activities (dict input) and
# the web (`target`) start analyses for real. The scaffold start (no `target`) then fails in
# analysis: one worker serves one path. The store must equal ARTIFACT_STORE_DIR.
ANALYSIS_ARTIFACT_STORE_DIR=/opt/cmp/artifact-store
ANALYSIS_WORKSPACE_ROOT=/opt/cmp/analysis-workspaces
#
# Real Sandbox loop (박승철님 값, 협의 필요). Place the dedicated `k3d-cmp-sandbox` kubeconfig at
# /opt/cmp/secrets/sandbox/kubeconfig (root, 0600) first, then SANDBOX_KUBECONFIG=/run/cmp/sandbox/kubeconfig.
# Empty: scaffold Sandbox; a real (`target`) start then stops at sbx_build.
SANDBOX_KUBECONFIG=
# JSON {"<resource id>": "<repo>@sha256:<digest>"} until all BUILD_* are set (runbook).
SANDBOX_PREBUILT_IMAGES=
#
# Claude (ADR-004, 협의 필요: 비용 한도·키 소유). Off unless true and a key is set.
LLM_ENABLED=false
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
#
# Ticket 57 (#228): the rehearsal's standard write -> read shape for web starts (API only), a
# SandboxSettings JSON object. This line is the demo app (demo-app main.go): POST /api/messages
# answers 201 with a server-made `id`; the same client_msg_id again answers 200 with the stored
# row, so the read-back is REPEAT_WRITE. Keep the single quotes (compose reads the JSON
# literally). Empty: the rehearsal runs the health test only. Another app needs its own shape.
WEB_START_SANDBOX_SETTINGS='{"write_path": "/api/messages", "write_body": {"client_msg_id": "std-{{run_id}}", "author": "cmp-rehearsal", "body": "value-{{run_id}}"}, "write_status": 201, "id_from_response": "id", "value_field": "body", "read_back": "REPEAT_WRITE"}'
